#: ../../getting_started/installation/3_node_ha/3_node_ha_paths.rst:2
msgid "Default Paths"
msgstr "Chemins par défaut"

#: ../../getting_started/installation/3_node_ha/3_node_ha_paths.rst:4
msgid ""
"|morpheus| follows several install location conventions. Below is a list "
"of the system paths."
msgstr "|morpheus| suit plusieurs conventions d'emplacement d'installation. Vous trouverez ci-dessous la liste des chemins système."

#: ../../getting_started/installation/3_node_ha/3_node_ha_paths.rst:6
msgid ""
"Altering the default system paths is not supported and may break "
"functionality."
msgstr "La modification des chemins système par défaut n'est pas prise en charge et peut entraîner des dysfonctionnements."

#: ../../getting_started/installation/3_node_ha/3_node_ha_paths.rst:8
msgid "Installation Location: ``/opt/morpheus``"
msgstr "Emplacement d'installation : ``/opt/morpheus``"

#: ../../getting_started/installation/3_node_ha/3_node_ha_paths.rst:9
msgid "Log Location: ``/var/log/morpheus``"
msgstr "Emplacement des journaux : ``/var/log/morpheus``"

#: ../../getting_started/installation/3_node_ha/3_node_ha_paths.rst:11
msgid "Morpheus-UI: ``/var/log/morpheus/morpheus-ui``"
msgstr "Morpheus-UI : ``/var/log/morpheus/morpheus-ui``"

#: ../../getting_started/installation/3_node_ha/3_node_ha_paths.rst:12
msgid "NginX: ``/var/log/morpheus/nginx``"
msgstr "NginX : ``/var/log/morpheus/nginx``"

#: ../../getting_started/installation/3_node_ha/3_node_ha_paths.rst:13
msgid "Check Server: ``/var/log/morpheus/check-server``"
msgstr "Check Server : ``/var/log/morpheus/check-server``"

#: ../../getting_started/installation/3_node_ha/3_node_ha_paths.rst:14
msgid "Elastic Search: ``/var/log/morpheus/elasticsearch``"
msgstr "Elastic Search : ``/var/log/morpheus/elasticsearch``"

#: ../../getting_started/installation/3_node_ha/3_node_ha_paths.rst:15
msgid "RabbitMQ: ``/var/log/morpheus/rabbitmq``"
msgstr "RabbitMQ : ``/var/log/morpheus/rabbitmq``"

#: ../../getting_started/installation/3_node_ha/3_node_ha_paths.rst:17
msgid "User-defined install/config: ``/etc/morpheus/morpheus.rb``"
msgstr "Installation/configuration définie par l'utilisateur : ``/etc/morpheus/morpheus.rb``"

#: ../../getting_started/installation/3_node_ha/3_node_ha_database_requirements.rst:2
msgid "MySQL requirements for Morpheus HA"
msgstr "Exigences MySQL pour Morpheus HA"

#: ../../getting_started/installation/3_node_ha/3_node_ha_database_requirements.rst:3
msgid "The requirements are as follows:"
msgstr "Les exigences sont les suivantes :"

#: ../../getting_started/installation/3_node_ha/3_node_ha_database_requirements.rst:5
msgid ""
"An external MySQL service. The 8.4 LTS family can be configured; confirm "
"the formally certified version and service variant for the installed "
"|morpheus| release."
msgstr "Un service MySQL externe. La famille 8.4 LTS peut être configurée ; confirmez la version certifiée officiellement et la variante de service pour la version |morpheus| installée."

#: ../../getting_started/installation/3_node_ha/3_node_ha_database_requirements.rst:6
msgid "MySQL cluster with at least 3 nodes for redundancy."
msgstr "Cluster MySQL d'au moins 3 nœuds pour la redondance."

#: ../../getting_started/installation/3_node_ha/3_node_ha_database_requirements.rst:7
msgid "Morpheus application nodes have connectivity to MySQL cluster."
msgstr "Les nœuds d'application Morpheus ont une connectivité vers le cluster MySQL."

#: ../../getting_started/installation/3_node_ha/3_node_ha_database_requirements.rst:9
#: ../../getting_started/installation/3_node_ha/3_node_ha_morpheus_rb.rst:1
#: ../../getting_started/installation/3_node_ha/3_node_ha_morpheus_rb.rst:96
#: ../../getting_started/installation/3_node_ha/3_node_ha_rabbit.rst:169
msgid "Note"
msgstr "Note"

#: ../../getting_started/installation/3_node_ha/3_node_ha_database_requirements.rst:9
msgid ""
"Morpheus does not create primary keys on all tables. If you use a "
"clustering technology that requires primary keys, you will need to "
"leverage the invisible primary key option in MySQL 8"
msgstr "Morpheus ne crée pas de clés primaires sur toutes les tables. Si vous utilisez une technologie de clustering qui exige des clés primaires, vous devrez exploiter l'option de clé primaire invisible dans MySQL 8"

#: ../../getting_started/installation/database_configure_generic.rst:2
msgid "Configure Morpheus Database and User"
msgstr "Configurer la base de données et l'utilisateur Morpheus"

#: ../../getting_started/installation/database_configure_generic.rst:4
msgid ""
"External MySQL configuration is supported, including the 8.4 LTS family. "
"Confirm the formally certified version and service variant for the "
"installed |morpheus| release, and review "
":doc:`/getting_started/external_services/mysql` before creating the "
"schema. ``8.4 or greater`` is not an unconditional support statement."
msgstr "La configuration MySQL externe est prise en charge, y compris la famille 8.4 LTS. Confirmez la version certifiée officiellement et la variante de service pour la version |morpheus| installée, et consultez :doc:`/getting_started/external_services/mysql` avant de créer le schéma. ``8.4 or greater`` n'est pas une déclaration de prise en charge inconditionnelle."

#: ../../getting_started/installation/database_configure_generic.rst:6
msgid ""
"Create the Database you will be using with |morpheus|. Login to mysql "
"node:"
msgstr "Créez la base de données que vous utiliserez avec |morpheus|. Connectez-vous au nœud mysql :"

#: ../../getting_started/installation/database_configure_generic.rst:8
msgid ""
"[root@node: ~]  mysql -u root -p\n"
"  # password: `enter root password`\n"
"\n"
"mysql> CREATE DATABASE morpheus CHARACTER SET utf8mb4 COLLATE "
"utf8mb4_general_ci;\n"
"\n"
"mysql> show databases;"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/installation/database_configure_generic.rst:18
msgid ""
"Next create your |morpheus| database user. This is the user the "
"|morpheus| app nodes will auth with mysql."
msgstr "Créez ensuite votre utilisateur de base de données |morpheus|. C'est l'utilisateur avec lequel les nœuds d'application |morpheus| s'authentifieront auprès de mysql."

#: ../../getting_started/installation/database_configure_generic.rst:20
msgid "mysql> CREATE USER 'morpheus'@'%' IDENTIFIED BY 'morpheusDbUserPassword';"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/installation/database_configure_generic.rst:24
msgid "Next Grant your new |morpheus| user permissions."
msgstr "Accordez ensuite les autorisations à votre nouvel utilisateur |morpheus|."

#: ../../getting_started/installation/database_configure_generic.rst:26
msgid ""
"mysql> GRANT ALL PRIVILEGES ON morpheus.* TO 'morpheus'@'%' with grant "
"option;\n"
"\n"
"mysql> GRANT SELECT, PROCESS, SHOW DATABASES, RELOAD ON *.* TO "
"'morpheus'@'%';\n"
"\n"
"mysql> FLUSH PRIVILEGES;\n"
"\n"
"mysql> exit"
msgstr ""

