#: ../../getting_started/installation/3_node_ha/3_node_ha_app_node.rst:44
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "Installation"

#: ../../getting_started/installation/3_node_ha/3_node_ha_app_node.rst:46
msgid ""
"First begin by downloading and installing the requisite |morpheus| "
"packages to ALL |morpheus| app nodes."
msgstr "Commencez par télécharger et installer les packages |morpheus| requis sur TOUS les nœuds d'application |morpheus|."

#: ../../getting_started/installation/3_node_ha/3_node_ha_app_node.rst:48
msgid ""
"|morpheus| packages can be found in the Downloads section of the "
"`Morpheus Hub <https://morpheushub.com/download>`_"
msgstr "Les packages |morpheus| se trouvent dans la section Téléchargements du `Morpheus Hub <https://morpheushub.com/download>`_"

#: ../../getting_started/installation/3_node_ha/3_node_ha_app_node.rst:55
msgid ""
"[root@node: ~] wget https://example/path/morpheus-appliance-"
"ver-1.el8.x86_64.rpm\n"
"[root@node: ~] rpm -ihv morpheus-appliance-appliance-ver-1.el8.x86_64.rpm"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/installation/3_node_ha/3_node_ha_app_node.rst:63
msgid ""
"[root@node: ~] wget https://example/path/morpheus-"
"appliance_ver-1.amd64.deb\n"
"[root@node: ~] dpkg -i morpheus-appliance-appliance_ver-1.amd64.deb"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/installation/3_node_ha/3_node_ha_app_node.rst:68
msgid ""
"Do NOT run reconfigure yet. The |morpheus| configuration file must be "
"edited prior to the initial reconfigure."
msgstr "Ne lancez PAS encore reconfigure. Le fichier de configuration |morpheus| doit être modifié avant le reconfigure initial."

#: ../../getting_started/installation/3_node_ha/3_node_ha_app_node.rst:70
msgid ""
"Next you will need to edit the |morpheus| configuration file "
"``/etc/morpheus/morpheus.rb`` on each node."
msgstr "Vous devrez ensuite modifier le fichier de configuration |morpheus| ``/etc/morpheus/morpheus.rb`` sur chaque nœud."

#: ../../getting_started/installation/3_node_ha/3_node_ha_morpheus_rb.rst:2
msgid ""
"In the configuration below, the UID and GID for the users and groups are "
"defined for services that will be embedded.  This ensures they are "
"consistent on all nodes. If they are not consistent, the shared storage "
"permissions can become out of sync and errors will appear for plugins, "
"images, etc. If not specified, Morpheus will automatically find available"
" UIDs/GIDs starting at 999 and work down. Availability of UIDs and GIDs "
"can be seen by inspecting ``/etc/passwd`` and ``/etc/group`` "
"respectively.  Change the UIDs and GIDs below based on what is available."
msgstr "Dans la configuration ci-dessous, l'UID et le GID des utilisateurs et groupes sont définis pour les services qui seront intégrés. Cela garantit leur cohérence sur tous les nœuds. S'ils ne sont pas cohérents, les autorisations du stockage partagé peuvent se désynchroniser et des erreurs apparaîtront pour les plug-ins, les images, etc. S'ils ne sont pas spécifiés, Morpheus trouvera automatiquement des UID/GID disponibles à partir de 999 et descendra. La disponibilité des UID et GID peut être vérifiée en inspectant ``/etc/passwd`` et ``/etc/group`` respectivement. Modifiez les UID et GID ci-dessous en fonction de ce qui est disponible."

#: ../../getting_started/installation/3_node_ha/3_node_ha_morpheus_rb.rst:8
msgid ""
"You can find additional configuration settings `here "
"<https://docs.morpheusdata.com/en/latest/getting_started/additional/additional_configuration.html"
"#advanced-morpheus-rb-settings>`_"
msgstr "Vous trouverez des paramètres de configuration supplémentaires `here <https://docs.morpheusdata.com/en/latest/getting_started/additional/additional_configuration.html#advanced-morpheus-rb-settings>`_"

#: ../../getting_started/installation/3_node_ha/3_node_ha_morpheus_rb.rst:15
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"appliance_url 'https://morpheus.localdomain'\n"
"elasticsearch['es_hosts'] = {'192.168.104.01' => 9200, '192.168.104.02' "
"=> 9200, '192.168.104.03' => 9200}\n"
"elasticsearch['node_name'] = '192.168.104.01'\n"
"elasticsearch['host'] = '0.0.0.0'\n"
"rabbitmq['host'] = '0.0.0.0'\n"
"rabbitmq['nodename'] = 'rabbit@node01'\n"
"mysql['enable'] = false\n"
"mysql['host'] = {'127.0.0.1' => 6446}\n"
"mysql['morpheus_db'] = 'morpheus'\n"
"mysql['morpheus_db_user'] = 'morpheus'\n"
"mysql['morpheus_password'] = 'morpheusDbUserPassword'\n"
"user['uid'] = 899\n"
"user['gid'] = 899\n"
"# at the time of this writing, local_user is not valid as an option so "
"the full entry is needed\n"
"node.default['morpheus_solo']['local_user']['uid'] = 898\n"
"node.default['morpheus_solo']['local_user']['gid'] = 898\n"
"elasticsearch['uid'] = 896\n"
"elasticsearch['gid'] = 896\n"
"rabbitmq['uid'] = 895\n"
"rabbitmq['gid'] = 895\n"
"guacd['uid'] = 894\n"
"guacd['gid'] = 894"
msgstr ""

